export const DESIGN = 'We used three methods: research from published sources, a site visit by two group members, and a structured survey of visitors. Research prioritises government publications, archaeological literature, institutional heritage records, and a university teaching text. Sources are compared claim by claim. Field observations and voluntary visitor responses are presented separately from documentary evidence.';
